{"language_code": "eng", "language_probability": 0.9869537353515625, "text": "Okay, I have to admit something about this bag. I've had the Velen Trail Weekender for months, and there are trips I just don't bring it on. It's cream canvas, so if it's raining or I'm getting in a cab or it's not a clean trip, it stays by the door. They finally fixed that. It's up in all black now. No canvas anywhere. It's leather the whole way through. Same size, same shape, same gold hardware, and the inside is still that caramel, which against black looks so much better than it should. Three days of clothes, still fits the overhead bin. It's a pre-order, so it ships mid-September, and they size the run off what gets ordered. Same $160. I already put mine in because this is the one I actually won't be careful with.", "words": [{"text": "Okay,", "start": 0.119, "end": 0.319, "type": "word", "logprob": -0.00018613827414810659}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.319, "end": 0.459, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"text": "I", "start": 0.459, "end": 0.5, "type": "word", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.5, "end": 0.56, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"text": "have", "start": 0.56, "end": 0.659, "type": "word", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.659, "end": 0.699, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"text": "to", "start": 0.699, "end": 0.759, "type": "word", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.759, "end": 0.779, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -7.390948667307384e-06}, {"text": "admit", "start": 0.779, "end": 0.959, "type": "word", "logprob": -7.390948667307384e-06}, {"text": " ", "start": 0.959, "end": 0.979, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"text": "something", "start": 0.979, "end": 1.179, "type": "word", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"text": " ", "start": 1.179, "end": 1.239, "type": "spacing", "logprob": -8.3446468579